#: ../../source/docs/qautotune-mode.rst:5 f631b389b7194cc9a5a70ab3aa419ede
msgid "QAUTOTUNE"
msgstr "QAUTOTUNE"

#: ../../source/docs/qautotune-mode.rst:7 245f8395afc1492d9d36b83a12cd981a
msgid ""
"``DEPRICATED: still available in custom builds.`` Use :ref:`quicktune`."
msgstr "``已弃用：仍在自定义构建中可用。`` 请使用 :ref:`quicktune`。"

#: ../../source/docs/qautotune-mode.rst:9 70bfec4314e348af9d8b3b660aa9741f
msgid ""
"Autotuning PIDs in QuadPlane is supported with this flight mode. This uses "
"the same system as the AUTOTUNE mode for copter. It should allow you to "
"improve the tune without having to manually adjust PIDs. It is not "
"recommended to use QAUTOTUNE for Tailsitter pitch or yaw axis, or any axis "
"which requires feed forward pid contributions."
msgstr ""
"此飞行模式支持 QuadPlane 的 PID 自动调参。使用与多旋翼 AUTOTUNE 模式相同的系统。它可以让您无需手动调整 PID "
"即可改善调参。不建议将 QAUTOTUNE 用于尾坐飞机的俯仰或偏航轴，或任何需要前馈 PID 贡献的轴。"

#: ../../source/docs/qautotune-mode.rst:12 7227188e6b0847728c3ec8caf6e5b78c
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/qautotune-mode.rst:14 9b0c687a4d0543a8865ed946c6590915
msgid ""
"Set QAUTOTUNE mode (mode 22) on one of your mode switch positions. It may "
"not show up as an available mode in your GCS, so you may need to set the "
"``FLTMODEn`` parameter in the full parameter list"
msgstr ""
"在模式开关的某个位置设置 QAUTOTUNE 模式（模式 22）。它可能不会在您的 GCS 中显示为可用模式，因此您可能需要在完整参数列表中设置 "
"``FLTMODEn`` 参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/qautotune-mode.rst:15 0128a4f026d44ea58c75d5cd4446c043
msgid ""
"Select which axes you want to tune with "
":ref:`Q_AUTOTUNE_AXES<Q_AUTOTUNE_AXES>`."
msgstr "使用 :ref:`Q_AUTOTUNE_AXES<Q_AUTOTUNE_AXES>` 选择要调参的轴。"

#: ../../source/docs/qautotune-mode.rst:18 7a285a7261f64d1683c56e1bcbe4fcd3
msgid "Operation"
msgstr "操作"

#: ../../source/docs/qautotune-mode.rst:20 f024cbaa01764fa08546c6d4c61e9ada
msgid ""
"QAUTOTUNE mode cannot be entered while disarmed, unlike many other QuadPlane"
" modes."
msgstr "与许多其他 QuadPlane 模式不同，QAUTOTUNE 模式在上锁时无法进入。"

#: ../../source/docs/qautotune-mode.rst:22 f2d245ba755b4874a721731dd33c9441
msgid ""
"As a QAUTOTUNE can take quite a long time (3 to 5 minutes per axis is "
"common) you may wish to tune one axis at a time. Choose whether you want "
"position hold support while tuning. If you enter QAUTOTUNE mode from QLOITER"
" then it will use a loose position hold, preventing wind from carrying it "
"away while tuning. If you start from QHOVER then it will not hold position, "
"and you may need to reposition while tuning, but it will only do tuning "
"(“twitching” to measure responses) while the sticks are centered."
msgstr ""
"由于 QAUTOTUNE 可能需要相当长的时间（每轴通常 3 至 5 分钟），您可能希望每次只调参一个轴。选择是否需要在调参时进行位置保持。如果从 "
"QLOITER 进入 QAUTOTUNE，它将使用松散的位置保持，防止风将其吹走。如果从 QHOVER "
"开始，它将不会保持位置，您可能需要在调参期间重新定位，但只有当摇杆居中时才会进行调参（「抖动」以测量响应）。"

#: ../../source/docs/qautotune-mode.rst:24 9bc64383e6e1419b9ac4589dd87a817d
msgid ""
"You may need to increase the deadzone (``RCx_DZ``) on your input channels or"
" re-calibrate your RC channels to ensure it can start the tune. Once you "
"start the tune it will “twitch” on the axis it is tuning. So if it is tuning"
" roll, then it does small sharp roll movements to measure response."
msgstr ""
"您可能需要增加输入通道的死区（``RCx_DZ``）或重新校准 RC "
"通道以确保可以开始调参。调参开始后，它将在正在调参的轴上「抖动」。因此如果正在调参横滚，它会做小幅快速的横滚运动以测量响应。"

#: ../../source/docs/qautotune-mode.rst:26 dc01e26bfab2462d9e4e2d8803e64a0a
msgid ""
"You can tell that QAUTOTUNE has finished when it stops twitching. You need "
"to then land while staying in QAUTOTUNE mode and disarm without changing "
"modes to save the tune. If you land in QAUTOTUNE and disarm after some axes "
"have completed ,but the whole tune is not complete, then the PIDs for the "
"axes that have completed will be saved."
msgstr ""
"当停止抖动时，可以判断 QAUTOTUNE 已完成。然后需要在保持 QAUTOTUNE 模式的情况下降落并上锁而不切换模式，以保存调参结果。如果在 "
"QAUTOTUNE 模式下降落并在部分轴完成但整体调参未完成时上锁，已完成轴的 PID 将会被保存。"

#: ../../source/docs/qautotune-mode.rst:28 7d17877431d0425d900ea6dc255695e6
msgid ""
"You can reposition while tuning by moving your sticks. Once you re-center "
"the sticks the tune will continue. If you change modes then the tune stops "
"immediately."
msgstr "可以通过移动摇杆在调参期间重新定位。摇杆回中后调参将继续。切换模式将立即停止调参。"

#: ../../source/docs/qautotune-mode.rst:30 79bc9209d16446c8ad95054cf1dc4c2b
msgid ""
"You can read more about AutoTune for copters here: :ref:`autotune`. The "
"autotune for quadplanes works the same way."
msgstr "您可以在此处阅读更多关于多旋翼 AutoTune 的内容：:ref:`autotune`。QuadPlane 的自动调参工作方式相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/qautotune-mode.rst:32 e8da11b1ab3140b4a42643343bef519e
msgid ""
"Like Copter, entering QAUTOTUNE from QLOITER will attempt a loose position "
"hold."
msgstr "与多旋翼一样，从 QLOITER 进入 QAUTOTUNE 将尝试松散位置保持。"
